const formatThaiDate=value=>{if(!value)return '';const d=new Date(value+'T00:00:00');return new Intl.DateTimeFormat('th-TH-u-ca-buddhist',{day:'numeric',month:'long',year:'numeric'}).format(d)};
const greeting=()=>{const h=new Date().getHours();return h<12?'สวัสดีตอนเช้า':h<18?'สวัสดีตอนบ่าย':'สวัสดีตอนเย็น'};
const weekActivity=history=>{const now=new Date(),monday=new Date(now.getFullYear(),now.getMonth(),now.getDate());monday.setDate(monday.getDate()-(monday.getDay()+6)%7);return Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>{const d=new Date(monday);d.setDate(d.getDate()+i);const key=[d.getFullYear(),String(d.getMonth()+1).padStart(2,'0'),String(d.getDate()).padStart(2,'0')].join('-'),items=history.filter(h=>h.date===key);return{key,label:new Intl.DateTimeFormat('th-TH',{weekday:'short'}).format(d),minutes:items.reduce((a,h)=>a+(h.minutes||0),0),workouts:items.length}})};
